[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2102.39, "timestamp": "00:35:02", "text": "呃，解锁超级留言之类的功能，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2104.71, "timestamp": "00:35:04", "text": "猜测。是啊，因为我得还钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2108.15, "timestamp": "00:35:08", "text": "所提供的商品以及所有那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2110.87, "timestamp": "00:35:10", "text": "现在所有这些东西。哦，是的。嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2113.03, "timestamp": "00:35:13", "text": "是的。是的。嗯，我要一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2115.589, "timestamp": "00:35:15", "text": "人们致力于此。但是，呃，如果呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2117.67, "timestamp": "00:35:17", "text": "最终可能就在今年或明年"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2120.55, "timestamp": "00:35:20", "text": "可能不行，我不知道，而且我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2123.95, "timestamp": "00:35:23", "text": "别引用我的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2127.589, "timestamp": "00:35:27", "text": "好的。呃，我的第一个美人鱼角色将会是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2130.71, "timestamp": "00:35:30", "text": "如果我发布了，它就是你的了。是的，我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2132.349, "timestamp": "00:35:32", "text": "我会尽力而为。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2137.109, "timestamp": "00:35:37", "text": "是的，我甚至还尝试过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2140.79, "timestamp": "00:35:40", "text": "就像某种货币化的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2142.99, "timestamp": "00:35:42", "text": "货币化或类似"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2147.95, "timestamp": "00:35:47", "text": "最近推出了一个仅限支持者访问的网站。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2152.349, "timestamp": "00:35:52", "text": "嗯，虽然它很好，但是，但是，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2156.03, "timestamp": "00:35:56", "text": "但你知道，它有这个功能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2158.109, "timestamp": "00:35:58", "text": "问题"}]